      "qHtml": "Young's modulus of elasticity $Y$ is expressed in terms of three derived quantities, namely, the gravitational constant $G$, Planck's constant $h$ and the speed of light $c$, as $Y=c^\\alpha h^\\beta G^\\gamma$. Which of the following is the correct option?",
