      "qHtml": "<p>The side of a cube is measured by vernier \ncallipers (10 divisions of a vernier scale \ncoincide with 9 divisions of main scale, \nwhere 1 division of main scale is 1 mm). The \nmain scale reads 10 mm and first division of \nvernier scale coincides with the main scale; \nMass of the cube is 2.736 g. Find the density \nof the cube in appropriate significant figures.</p>",
