      "s": "IIT-JEE 2010 Paper 2 Offline. Correct option: D. In Vernier scale, 16 mm is divided into 20 parts, that is,\n\n1 VSD = 16/20 mm.\n\nLeast count = 1 MSD $$-$$ 1 VSD\n\n$$LC = \\left( {1 - {{16} \\over {20}}} \\right)$$ mm = 0.22 mm",
