        "<img class=\"quiz-question-image\" src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/1l2y4trug/48172183-7fa2-4f0f-93f1-b19214ea0f7a/9349ab80-cf43-11ec-96c2-cfdd3edc6cd1/file-1l2y4truh.png\" alt=\"IIT-JEE 2010 Paper 1 Offline Physics - Laws of Motion Question 28 English Option 3\" loading=\"lazy\">",
