      "s": "IIT-JEE 2006. Correct option: B. Two blocks A and B of mass 2 m and m respectively are connected by a massless and in extensible string.\n\n[Diagram: IIT-JEE 2006 Physics - Laws of Motion Question 2 English Explanation]\n\nThe equilibrium condition FBD of 2 m\n\n$$ k x=\\mathrm{T}+2 m g=m g+2 m g=3 m g $$\n\nAfter the string is cut.\n\n$$ \\mathrm{T}=0 $$\n\nFBD of $2 m, a_2=\\frac{3 m g-2 m g}{2 m}=\\frac{m g}{2 m}=\\frac{g}{2}$\n\nFBD of $m, m a_1=m g=\\mathrm{T}$\n\n$$ \\therefore a_1=g $$",
