      "qHtml": "<p>A block of mass 2 kg is free to move along the x-axis. It is at rest and from t = 0 onwards, it is subjected to a time-dependent force F(t) in the x-direction. The force F(t) varies with t as shown in the figure. The kinetic energy of the block after 4.5 s is</p>\n<p><img class=\"quiz-question-image\" src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/1l4bkrh4r/41205e7d-b7c1-4f7c-87bb-b61a42d8b283/4d47f4b0-ea74-11ec-a537-3baab2e403e6/file-1l4bkrh4s.png\" alt=\"IIT-JEE 2010 Paper 2 Offline Physics - Work Power &amp; Energy Question 8 English\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>",
