      "qHtml": "<p>Two blocks A and B of masses $2 m$ and $m$, respectively, are connected by a massless and inextensible string. The whole system is suspended by a massless spring as shown in the figure. The magnitudes of acceleration of A and B, immediately after the string is cut, are respectively,</p><img class=\"quiz-question-image\" src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/jaoe38c1mgt0t0of/add60d9c-fa6a-4d3c-b908-51222fe214ab/bf7bb3f0-aa56-11f0-b4b0-a3aba211cddc/file-jaoe38c1mgt0t0og.png\" alt=\"IIT-JEE 2006 Physics - Laws of Motion Question 2 English\" loading=\"lazy\">",
