      "q": "A block of mass $5 \\mathrm{~kg}$ moves along the $x$-direction subject to the force $F=(-20 x+10) \\mathrm{N}$, with the value of $x$ in metre. At time $t=0 \\mathrm{~s}$, it is at rest at position $x=1 \\mathrm{~m}$. The position and momentum of the block at $t={\\pi \\over 4} \\mathrm{s}$ are",
      "qHtml": "<p>A block of mass $5 \\mathrm{~kg}$ moves along the $x$-direction subject to the force $F=(-20 x+10) \\mathrm{N}$, with the value of $x$ in metre. At time $t=0 \\mathrm{~s}$, it is at rest at position $x=1 \\mathrm{~m}$. The position and momentum of the block at $t={\\pi  \\over 4} \\mathrm{s}$ are</p>",
