      "qHtml": "<p>A ball of mass (m) 0.5 kg is attached to the end of a string having length (L) 0.5 m. The ball is rotated on a horizontal circular path about vertical axis. The maximum tension that the string can bear is 324 N. The\nmaximum possible value of angular velocity of ball (in radian/s) is</p>\n<p><img class=\"quiz-question-image\" src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/1l2jfavhj/ba33dbb3-8900-4ecf-a0c1-a084f658d040/c867d860-c72c-11ec-9e4a-bf17a41218c9/file-1l2jfavhk.png\" alt=\"IIT-JEE 2011 Paper 1 Offline Physics - Laws of Motion Question 27 English\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>",
