      "q": "A flat surface of a thin uniform disk $A$ of radius $R$ is glued to a horizontal table. Another thin uniform disk $B$ of mass $M$ and with the same radius $R$ rolls without slipping on the circumference of $A$, as shown in the figure. A flat surface of $B$ also lies on the plane of the table. The center of mass of $B$ has fixed angular speed $\\omega$ about the vertical axis passing through the center of $A$. The angular momentum of $B$ is $n M \\omega R^{2}$ with respect to the center of $A$. Which of the following is the value of $n$ ?\n\n[Diagram: JEE Advanced 2022 Paper 2 Online Physics - Rotational Motion Question 31 English]",
      "qHtml": "<p>A flat surface of a thin uniform disk $A$ of radius $R$ is glued to a horizontal table. Another thin uniform disk $B$ of mass $M$ and with the same radius $R$ rolls without slipping on the circumference of $A$, as shown in the figure. A flat surface of $B$ also lies on the plane of the table. The center of mass of $B$ has fixed angular speed $\\omega$ about the vertical axis passing through the center of $A$. The angular momentum of $B$ is $n M \\omega R^{2}$ with respect to the center of $A$. Which of the following is the value of $n$ ?</p>\n<p><img class=\"quiz-question-image\" src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/1l7gaaxyj/c0c96b0a-344c-4bc6-89de-f2fe8d927b5a/f79dd3b0-286f-11ed-960a-ef6c69c8b437/file-1l7gaaxyk.png\" alt=\"JEE Advanced 2022 Paper 2 Online Physics - Rotational Motion Question 31 English\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>",
