      "s": "JEE Advanced 2022 Paper 2 Online. Correct option: B. Angular momentum of $B$ with respect to center of $A$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\vec{L} & =\\vec{L}_{C M}+\\vec{L}_{\\text {Body about CM }} \\\\\\\\\n& =M(2 R)^2 \\omega \\hat{k}+\\frac{M R^2}{2}\\left(\\omega_{\\text {body }}\\right) \\hat{k} \\\\\\\\\n& =M(2 R)^2 \\omega \\hat{k}+\\frac{M R^2}{2}(2 \\omega) \\hat{k} \\\\\\\\\n& =5 M R^2 \\omega \\hat{k}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nComparing the magnitude with $n M \\omega R^2$\n\n$$\nn=5\n$$",
      "source": "JEE Advanced 2022 Paper 2 Online | Rotational Motion | l7gaby6v",
      "pyq": true,
