      "qHtml": "Two identical discs of same radius R are rotating about their axes in\nopposite directions with the same constant angular speed $$\\omega $$. The\ndiscs are in the same horizontal plane. At time t = 0, the points P\nand Q are facing each other as shown in the figure. The relative\nspeed between the two points P and Q is v<sub>r</sub>. In one time period (T)\nof rotation of the discs, v<sub>r</sub> as a function of time is best represented\nby<br><img class=\"quiz-question-image\" src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/1l253pwrf/e0b97c1e-5121-4e85-8649-96f0433caf1e/83e2eeb0-bf4c-11ec-b997-87cc5d16a405/file-1l253pwrg.png\" alt=\"IIT-JEE 2012 Paper 2 Offline Physics - Rotational Motion Question 72 English\" loading=\"lazy\">",
