      "qHtml": "<p>A small mass m is attached to a massless string whose other end is fixed at P as shown in the figure. The mass is undergoing circular motion in the xy-plane with centre at O and constant angular speed $$\\omega$$. If the angular momentum of the system, calculated about O and P are denoted by $${\\overrightarrow L _O}$$ and $${\\overrightarrow L _P}$$, respectively, then</p>\n<p><img class=\"quiz-question-image\" src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/1l24kk3qd/b1f8873d-59f8-4a08-bf6b-5d5d0192172d/94f63a40-bf01-11ec-a939-59543093f185/file-1l24kk3qe.png\" alt=\"IIT-JEE 2012 Paper 1 Offline Physics - Rotational Motion Question 37 English\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>",
