      "qHtml": "<p>STATEMENT 1</p>\n<p>If there is no external torque on a body about its center of mass, then the velocity of the center of mass remains constant.</p>\n<p>Because</p>\n<p>STATEMENT 2</p>\n<p>The linear momentum of an isolated system remains constant.</p>",
