      "s": "IIT-JEE 2007 Paper 2 Offline. Correct option: D. Statement 1 : For velocity of centre of mass remains constant, net force acting on body must be zero. Therefore the statement 1 is false.\n\nStatement 2 : The linear momentum of an isolated system remains constant. The statement is true.",
