      "q": "A thin wire of length $L$ and uniform linear mass density $\\rho$ is bent into a circular loop with centre at $O$ as shown. The moment of inertia of the loop about the axis $XX'$ is:\n\n[Diagram: IIT-JEE 2000 Physics - Rotational Motion Question 10 English]",
      "qHtml": "<p>A thin wire of length $L$ and uniform linear mass density $\\rho$ is bent into a circular loop with centre at $O$ as shown. The moment of inertia of the loop about the axis $XX'$ is:</p>\n<img class=\"quiz-question-image\" src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/jaoe38c1lycbxqwd/be7e0c63-4f2e-478a-bc3a-7524f436b23c/0f88f1d0-3ccd-11ef-95a4-e32eea7d1df6/file-jaoe38c1lycbxqwe.png\" alt=\"IIT-JEE 2000 Physics - Rotational Motion Question 10 English\" loading=\"lazy\">",
