      "qHtml": "<p>A particle of mass <i>m</i>, and angular momentum <i>&#8467;</i> is moving in a circular orbit of radius <i>r</i><sub>0</sub> under the influence of an attractive force $\\vec{F}(r)=-\\frac{k}{r^2} \\hat{r}$. Keeping its angular momentum unchanged, the particle is displaced radially by a small distance $\\delta r \\ll r_0$, due to which its radial distance varies periodically. The corresponding time period is :</p>",
