      "qHtml": "<p>If the density of air is $$\\rho$$<sub>a</sub> and that of the liquid $$\\rho$$<sub>l</sub>, then for a given piston speed the rate (volume per unit time) at which the liquid is sprayed will be proportional to</p>",
