      "qHtml": "A thin uniform cylindrical shell, closed at both ends, is partially filled with water. It is floating\nvertically in water in half-submerged state. If $${\\rho _c}$$ is the relative density of the material of the shell\nwith respect to water, then the correct statement is that the shell is",
