      "s": "JEE Advanced 2016 Paper 1 Offline. Correct option: B. Heat generated in device in 3 h\n\n= Time $$\\times$$ power\n\n= 3 $$\\times$$ 3600 $$\\times$$ 3 $$\\times$$ 10 3 = 324 $$\\times$$ 10 5 J\n\nHeat used to heat water = ms $$\\Delta$$ $$\\theta$$\n\n= 120 $$\\times$$ 1 $$\\times$$ 4.2 $$\\times$$ 10 3 $$\\times$$ 20J\n\nHeat absorbed by coolant\n\nPt = 324 $$\\times$$ 10 5 $$-$$ 120 $$\\times$$ 1 $$\\times$$ 4.2 $$\\times$$ 10 3 $$\\times$$ 20J\n\nPt = (325 $$-$$ 100.8) $$\\times$$ 10 5 J = 223.2 $$\\times$$ 10 5 J\n\nP = $${{223.2 \\times {{10}^5}} \\over {3600}}$$ = 2067 W",
