      "qHtml": "An ideal gas is in thermodynamic equilibrium. The number of degrees of freedom of a molecule of the gas is $n$. The internal energy of one mole of the gas is $U_n$ and the speed of sound in the gas is $\\mathrm{v}_n$. At a fixed temperature and pressure, which of the following is the correct option?",
