      "q": "One mole of a monatomic ideal gas undergoes the cyclic process $\\mathrm{J} \\rightarrow \\mathrm{K} \\rightarrow \\mathrm{L} \\rightarrow \\mathrm{M} \\rightarrow \\mathrm{J}$, as shown in the P-T diagram.\n\n[Diagram: JEE Advanced 2024 Paper 1 Online Physics - Heat and Thermodynamics Question 13 English]\n\nMatch the quantities mentioned in List-I with their values in List-II and choose the correct option.\n\n[ $\\mathcal{R}$ is the gas constant.]\n\nList-I\nList-II\n\n(P) Work done in the complete cyclic process\n(1) $RT_0 - 4RT_0 \\ln 2$\n\n(Q) Change in the internal energy of the gas in the process JK\n(2) $0$\n\n(R) Heat given to the gas in the process KL\n(3) $3RT_0$\n\n(S) Change in the internal energy of the gas in the process MJ\n(4) $-2RT_0 \\ln 2$\n\n(5) $-3RT_0 \\ln 2$",
      "qHtml": "<p>One mole of a monatomic ideal gas undergoes the cyclic process $\\mathrm{J} \\rightarrow \\mathrm{K} \\rightarrow \\mathrm{L} \\rightarrow \\mathrm{M} \\rightarrow \\mathrm{J}$, as shown in the P-T diagram.</p>\n\n<img class=\"quiz-question-image\" src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/6y3zli1lwpwe12y/ad330026-489f-4b5e-a478-1d85650a17a0/cc9d65a0-1caa-11ef-a7f1-8b6b33c30c4d/file-6y3zli1lwpwe12z.png\" alt=\"JEE Advanced 2024 Paper 1 Online Physics - Heat and Thermodynamics Question 13 English\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n<p>Match the quantities mentioned in List-I with their values in List-II and choose the correct option.</p>\n\n<p>[ $\\mathcal{R}$ is the gas constant.]</p>\n\n\n<table>\n \n    <thead>\n        <tr>\n            <th>List-I</th>\n            <th>List-II</th>\n        </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td>(P) Work done in the complete cyclic process</td>\n            <td>(1) $RT_0 - 4RT_0 \\ln 2$</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>(Q) Change in the internal energy of the gas in the process JK</td>\n            <td>(2) $0$</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>(R) Heat given to the gas in the process KL</td>\n            <td>(3) $3RT_0$</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td>(S) Change in the internal energy of the gas in the process MJ</td>\n            <td>(4) $-2RT_0 \\ln 2$</td>\n        </tr>\n        <tr>\n            <td></td>\n            <td>(5) $-3RT_0 \\ln 2$</td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>",
