      "q": "An ideal gas undergoes a four step cycle as shown in the P-V diagram below. During this cycle, heat is absorbed by the gas in\n\n[Diagram: JEE Advanced 2021 Paper 1 Online Physics - Heat and Thermodynamics Question 47 English]",
      "qHtml": "An ideal gas undergoes a four step cycle as shown in the P-V diagram below. During this cycle, heat is absorbed by the gas in <br><br><img class=\"quiz-question-image\" src=\"https://imagex.cdn.examgoal.net/1kuckfqvb/f0e7dc7d-f3fd-4969-8399-3351b44393e9/a5f42d70-2505-11ec-b291-1df06cb45b25/file-1kuckfqvc.png\" alt=\"JEE Advanced 2021 Paper 1 Online Physics - Heat and Thermodynamics Question 47 English\" loading=\"lazy\">",
