      "qHtml": "<p>The phase space diagram for simple harmonic motion is a circle centred at the origin. In the figure, the two circles represent the same oscillator but for different initial conditions, and E<sub>1</sub> and E<sub>2</sub> are the total mechanical energies respectively. Then</p>\n<p><img class=\"quiz-question-image\" src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/1l2lo8kea/d482c3f9-f9f4-40f3-9672-ce23350bc7d9/4baea220-c869-11ec-830c-7163a5cc8dc8/file-1l2lo8keb.png\" alt=\"IIT-JEE 2011 Paper 1 Offline Physics - Simple Harmonic Motion Question 18 English\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>",
