      "q": "A whistling train approaches a junction. An\nobserver standing at the junction observes\nthe frequency to be 2.2 kHz and 1.8 kHz\nof the approaching and the receding train.\nFind the speed of the train (speed of sound\n= 300 m/s).",
      "qHtml": "<p>A whistling train approaches a junction. An \nobserver standing at the junction observes \nthe frequency to be 2.2 kHz and 1.8 kHz \nof the approaching and the receding train. \nFind the speed of the train (speed of sound \n= 300 m/s).</p>",
