      "s": "JEE Advanced 2023 Paper 2 Online. Correct option: B. $$\nV_1 \\propto \\frac{p_1 \\cos \\theta_1}{r_1^3}\n$$\n\n[Diagram: JEE Advanced 2023 Paper 2 Online Physics - Electrostatics Question 12 English Explanation 1]\n\n$$\nV_2 \\propto \\frac{p_2 \\cos \\theta_2}{r_2^3}\n$$\n\n[Diagram: JEE Advanced 2023 Paper 2 Online Physics - Electrostatics Question 12 English Explanation 2]\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n& \\frac{V_2}{V_1}=\\frac{p_2 \\cos \\theta_2}{p_1 \\cos \\theta_1} \\\\\\\\\n& \\frac{V_2}{V_1}=\\frac{q(-2 \\hat{i}+4 \\hat{j}) \\cdot(\\hat{i}+\\hat{j})}{q(0 \\hat{i}+4 \\hat{j}) \\cdot(\\hat{i}+\\hat{j})}=\\frac{1}{2}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n$$\n\\Rightarrow V_2=\\frac{V_0}{2}\n$$",
