      "s": "JEE Advanced 2014 Paper 2 Offline. Correct option: C. Electric field due to uniformly charged dielectric solid sphere of radius R at a point P is given by\n\n[Diagram: JEE Advanced 2014 Paper 2 Offline Physics - Electrostatics Question 63 English Explanation]\n\n$$E = \\left\\{ {\\matrix{\n{k\\,.\\,{Q \\over {{R^3}}}\\,.\\,r,} & {r \\le R} \\cr\n{k\\,.\\,{Q \\over {{r^2}}},} & {r > R} \\cr\n\n} } \\right.$$\n\nIn first two cases, P is outside the sphere. Therefore,\n\n$${E_1} = {1 \\over {4\\pi {E_0}}}.\\,{Q \\over {{R^2}}}$$ ..... (1)\n\n$${E_2} = {1 \\over {4\\pi {E_0}}}.\\,{{2Q} \\over {{R^2}}}$$ .... (2)\n\nIn Sphere 3, point P located is inside. Therefore,\n\n$${E_3} = \\left( {{\\rho \\over {3{E_0}}}} \\right)r$$\n\n$$\\rho = {{4Q} \\over {(4/3)\\pi {{(2R)}^3}}}$$\n\n$$ = {{12Q} \\over {4\\pi \\,.\\,8{R^3}}} = {{3Q} \\over {8\\pi }}$$\n\n$${E_3} = \\left( {{{3Q} \\over {\\pi {R^3}}}} \\right)R$$\n\n$${E_3} = {1 \\over {4\\pi {E_0}}}\\,.\\,{Q \\over {2{R^2}}}$$ ..... (3)\n\n$${E_2} > {E_1} > {E_3}$$",
