      "qHtml": "<p>A spherical portion has been removed from a solid sphere having a charge distributed uniformly in its volume as shown in the figure. The electric field inside the emptied space is</p>\n<p><img class=\"quiz-question-image\" src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/1lguerkm4/552d9869-17e7-4135-98a7-cc8efcfb9f9b/5614f5c0-e262-11ed-8ec0-d5a0bb2b1e44/file-1lguerkm5.png\" alt=\"IIT-JEE 2007 Paper 2 Offline Physics - Electrostatics Question 15 English\" loading=\"lazy\"></p>",
