      "s": "IIT-JEE 2006. Correct option: D. $$ \\begin{aligned} &\\begin{aligned} q & =\\mathrm{Q}_0 \\cos \\omega t \\\\ i & =\\frac{d q}{d t}=\\mathrm{Q}_0 \\omega \\sin \\omega t \\end{aligned}\\\\ &\\text { From conservation of energy. }\\\\ &\\begin{aligned} \\frac{1}{2} \\mathrm{LI}_{\\max }^2 & =\\frac{1}{2} \\mathrm{CV}^2 \\\\ \\mathrm{I}_{\\max } & =\\sqrt{\\frac{\\mathrm{CV}^2 \\times \\frac{1}{2}}{\\frac{1}{2} \\mathrm{~L}}}=\\mathrm{V} \\sqrt{\\frac{\\mathrm{C}}{\\mathrm{~L}}} \\end{aligned} \\end{aligned} $$",
