      "qHtml": "<p>Match the following columns.</p>\n<p>\n<table>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<thead>\n  <tr>\n    <th></th>\n    <th>Column I</th>\n    <th></th>\n    <th>Column II</th>\n  </tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n  <tr>\n    <td>(A)</td>\n    <td>Dielectric ring uniformly charged.</td>\n    <td>(P)</td>\n    <td>Time independent electrostatic field out of system.</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>(B)</td>\n    <td>Dielectric ring uniformly charged rotating with angular velocity $$\\omega$$.</td>\n    <td>(Q)</td>\n    <td>Magnetic field.</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>(C)</td>\n    <td>Constant current in ring $$io$$</td>\n    <td>(R)</td>\n    <td>Induced electric field.</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td>(D)</td>\n    <td>$$i=i_0\\cos\\omega t$$</td>\n    <td>(S)</td>\n    <td>Magnetic moment.</td>\n  </tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></p>",
