      "q": "List-I contains four conducting loops lying in the $XY$ plane, as shown in the figures. The loops are rotating about $Z$ axis passing through the point $O$ with time period $T$ in clockwise direction.\n\nThe region $x>0$ contains a uniform magnetic field $B$ in the $+z$ direction. List-II contains the qualitative variation of the induced current $i(t)$ for each of these loops. Choose the option which describes the correct match between the entries in List-I to those in List-II.\n\nList-I\nList-II\n\n(P)\n\n[Diagram: JEE Advanced 2026 Paper 1 Online Physics - Electromagnetic Induction Question 1 English 1]\n\n(1)\n\n[Diagram: JEE Advanced 2026 Paper 1 Online Physics - Electromagnetic Induction Question 1 English 2]\n\n(Q)\n\n[Diagram: JEE Advanced 2026 Paper 1 Online Physics - Electromagnetic Induction Question 1 English 3]\n\n(2)\n\n[Diagram: JEE Advanced 2026 Paper 1 Online Physics - Electromagnetic Induction Question 1 English 4]\n\n(R)\n\n[Diagram: JEE Advanced 2026 Paper 1 Online Physics - Electromagnetic Induction Question 1 English 5]\n\n(3)\n\n[Diagram: JEE Advanced 2026 Paper 1 Online Physics - Electromagnetic Induction Question 1 English 6]\n\n(S)\n\n[Diagram: JEE Advanced 2026 Paper 1 Online Physics - Electromagnetic Induction Question 1 English 7]\n\n(4)\n[Diagram: JEE Advanced 2026 Paper 1 Online Physics - Electromagnetic Induction Question 1 English 8]\n\n(5)\n[Diagram: JEE Advanced 2026 Paper 1 Online Physics - Electromagnetic Induction Question 1 English 9]",
      "qHtml": "<p>List-I contains four conducting loops lying in the $XY$ plane, as shown in the figures. The loops are rotating about $Z$ axis passing through the point $O$ with time period $T$ in clockwise direction.</p>\n<p>The region $x&gt;0$ contains a uniform magnetic field $B$ in the $+z$ direction. List-II contains the qualitative variation of the induced current $i(t)$ for each of these loops. Choose the option which describes the correct match between the entries in List-I to those in List-II.</p>\n<table>\n\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th>List-I</th>\n      <th>List-II</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n\n  <tbody>\n\n    <tr>\n      <td>\n        <strong>(P)</strong><br><br>\n\n        <img class=\"quiz-question-image\" src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/6y3zli1mp9x0jo3/bc1df9bd-54db-4ac8-8a01-6e41f11c46c7/fa5f2e30-5202-11f1-af7d-734b282814df/file-6y3zli1mp9x0jo4.png\" alt=\"JEE Advanced 2026 Paper 1 Online Physics - Electromagnetic Induction Question 1 English 1\" loading=\"lazy\">\n      </td>\n\n      <td>\n        <strong>(1)</strong><br><br>\n\n        <img class=\"quiz-question-image\" src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/6y3zli1mp9x0tke/a511368f-ce4c-43bb-a487-9dd173af6c6d/02046ce0-5203-11f1-af7d-734b282814df/file-6y3zli1mp9x0tkf.png\" alt=\"JEE Advanced 2026 Paper 1 Online Physics - Electromagnetic Induction Question 1 English 2\" loading=\"lazy\">\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n\n    <tr>\n      <td>\n        <strong>(Q)</strong><br><br>\n\n        <img class=\"quiz-question-image\" src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/6y3zli1mp9x13yn/c7398549-a454-4fd9-8383-b299d04e34f2/0a0c3df0-5203-11f1-af7d-734b282814df/file-6y3zli1mp9x13yo.png\" alt=\"JEE Advanced 2026 Paper 1 Online Physics - Electromagnetic Induction Question 1 English 3\" loading=\"lazy\">\n      </td>\n\n      <td>\n        <strong>(2)</strong><br><br>\n\n       <img class=\"quiz-question-image\" src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/6y3zli1mp9x1cm2/33d9f83b-494e-4e10-955e-8e5fe0447c3a/10bae7a0-5203-11f1-af7d-734b282814df/file-6y3zli1mp9x1cm3.png\" alt=\"JEE Advanced 2026 Paper 1 Online Physics - Electromagnetic Induction Question 1 English 4\" loading=\"lazy\">\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n\n    <tr>\n      <td>\n        <strong>(R)</strong><br><br>\n\n        <img class=\"quiz-question-image\" src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/6y3zli1mp9x1lbx/e74ec544-31f2-4ac0-861f-1dc6bb3e00da/1776fed0-5203-11f1-af7d-734b282814df/file-6y3zli1mp9x1lby.png\" alt=\"JEE Advanced 2026 Paper 1 Online Physics - Electromagnetic Induction Question 1 English 5\" loading=\"lazy\"> \n      </td>\n\n      <td>\n        <strong>(3)</strong><br><br>\n\n        <img class=\"quiz-question-image\" src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/6y3zli1mp9x1uwb/5226589a-1ff3-447e-a8f1-a1626b68b98c/1edac7b0-5203-11f1-af7d-734b282814df/file-6y3zli1mp9x1uwc.png\" alt=\"JEE Advanced 2026 Paper 1 Online Physics - Electromagnetic Induction Question 1 English 6\" loading=\"lazy\">\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n\n    <tr>\n      <td>\n        <strong>(S)</strong><br><br>\n<img class=\"quiz-question-image\" src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/6y3zli1mp9x24e4/b5b44361-b21c-4ec1-91a6-46cc3d58c9fc/26305fc0-5203-11f1-af7d-734b282814df/file-6y3zli1mp9x24e5.png\" alt=\"JEE Advanced 2026 Paper 1 Online Physics - Electromagnetic Induction Question 1 English 7\" loading=\"lazy\">\n       \n      </td>\n\n      <td>\n        <strong>(4)</strong> <img class=\"quiz-question-image\" src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/6y3zli1mp9x2e6x/78d7df20-0c2a-4452-bd1d-ff58a8d89b9c/2dc26490-5203-11f1-af7d-734b282814df/file-6y3zli1mp9x2e6y.png\" alt=\"JEE Advanced 2026 Paper 1 Online Physics - Electromagnetic Induction Question 1 English 8\" loading=\"lazy\">\n\n    \n      </td>\n    </tr>\n\n  <tr>\n      <td>\n       \n       \n      </td>\n\n      <td>\n      \n        <strong>(5)</strong> <img class=\"quiz-question-image\" src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/6y3zli1mp9x2orj/e2050915-a199-41c7-97ca-f2366b87174d/35ed26f0-5203-11f1-af7d-734b282814df/file-6y3zli1mp9x2ork.png\" alt=\"JEE Advanced 2026 Paper 1 Online Physics - Electromagnetic Induction Question 1 English 9\" loading=\"lazy\">\n      </td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n\n</table>",
