      "a": 2,
      "s": "JEE Advanced 2014 Paper 2 Offline. Correct option: C. [Diagram: JEE Advanced 2014 Paper 2 Offline Physics - Geometrical Optics Question 45 English Explanation]\n\nIn $$\\Delta$$SAB\n\n$$\\tan \\theta = {{AB} \\over {AS}} = {{11.54/2} \\over {10}}$$\n\ntan$$\\theta$$ = 0.577\n\n$$\\theta$$ = 30$$^\\circ$$\n\nUsing $${{\\sin {\\theta _l}} \\over {\\sin 90}} = {{{n_l}} \\over {{n_B}}}$$, we get\n\n$$\\sin {\\theta _l} = {{{n_l}} \\over {{n_B}}}$$ or $${n_l} = {n_B} \\times \\sin 30 = 2.72 \\times {1 \\over 2} = 1.36$$",
