      "s": "IIT-JEE 2012 Paper 2 Offline. Correct option: C. For meta-material, the refractive index is negative. Let n 1 is refractive index of air and n 2 is refractive index of meta-material.\n\n$$\\therefore$$ From Snell's law, $${{\\sin {\\theta _1}} \\over {\\sin {\\theta _2}}} = {{{n_2}} \\over {{n_1}}}$$\n\nSince, n 2 is negative, therefore $$\\theta$$ 2 is also negative. Hence, appropriate diagram (c) is correct.",
