      "qHtml": "<p>A point object is placed at a distance of 20 cm from a thin plano-convex lens of focal length 15 cm , if the plane surface is silvered. The image will form at</p><img class=\"quiz-question-image\" src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/jaoe38c1mgt0vp49/db9b106f-bcfe-4054-9aaf-4aa09eedb033/09fb0d90-aa57-11f0-b4b0-a3aba211cddc/file-jaoe38c1mgt0vp4a.png\" alt=\"IIT-JEE 2006 Physics - Geometrical Optics Question 4 English\" loading=\"lazy\">",
