      "q": "A metal surface is illuminated by light of two different wavelengths 248 nm and 310 nm. The maximum speeds of the photoelectrons corresponding to these wavelengths are u 1 and u 2 , respectively. If the ratio u 1 : u 2 = 2 : 1 and hc = 1240 eV nm, the work function of the metal is nearly",
