      "q": "Given that the abundances of isotopes 54 Fe, 56 Fe and 57 Fe are 5%, 90% and 5%, respectively, the atomic mass of Fe is :",
      "qHtml": "Given that the abundances of isotopes <sup>54</sup>Fe, <sup>56</sup>Fe and <sup>57</sup>Fe are 5%, 90% and 5%, respectively, the atomic mass of Fe is :",
