      "qHtml": "Consider the Bohr's model of a one-electron atom where the electron moves around the nucleus. In the following List-I contains some quantities for the nth orbit of the atom and List-II contains options showing how they depend on n.<br><br><img class=\"quiz-question-image\" src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/1kwtj0nsw/82ab097a-6164-431e-8574-bfbc4051200f/db1db800-55f1-11ec-8201-09ef4d4fb1d6/file-1kwtj0nsx.png\" alt=\"JEE Advanced 2019 Paper 2 Offline Chemistry - Structure of Atom Question 12 English\" loading=\"lazy\"><br>Which of the following options has the correct combination considering List-I and List-II?",
