      "q": "The electronic configuration of an element is 1s 2 , 2s 2 2p 6 , 3s 2 3p 6 3d 5 , 4s 1 This represents its",
      "qHtml": "The electronic configuration of an element is 1s<sup>2</sup>, 2s<sup>2</sup> 2p<sup>6</sup>, 3s<sup>2</sup> 3p<sup>6</sup> 3d<sup>5</sup>,  4s<sup>1</sup> This represents its",
