      "qHtml": "Read the following statement and explanation and answer as per the options given below<br><br>\n<b>ASSERTION :</b>  The first ionization energy of Be is greater than that of B.<br><br>\n<b>REASON :</b> 2p orbital is lower in energy than 2s.",
