      "s": "JEE Advanced 2013 Paper 2 Offline. Correct option: B. From the above solution, we have\n\nFrom K$$\\to$$L : heating (isobaric)\n\nFrom L$$\\to$$M : cooling (isochoric)\n\nFrom M$$\\to$$N : cooling (isobaric)\n\nFrom N$$\\to$$K : heating (isochoric)",
