      "q": "M is molecular weight of KMnO 4 . The equivalent wight of KMnO 4 when it is converted into K 2 MnO 4 is",
      "qHtml": "M is molecular weight of KMnO<sub>4</sub>. The equivalent wight of KMnO<sub>4</sub> when it is converted into K<sub>2</sub>MnO<sub>4</sub> is",
