      "s": "IIT-JEE 2008 Paper 1 Offline. Correct option: B. $$\\matrix{\n{\\mathop {{x_{ethanol}} = 0.1}\\limits_{(\\mathrm{Solute \\equiv B})} } & : & {\\mathop {{x_{water}} = 0.9}\\limits_{(\\mathrm{Solvent \\equiv A})} } \\cr\n\n} $$\n\n$$\\Delta {T_b} = {K_b}\\,.\\,m = {K_b}\\,.\\,{{{x_B}} \\over {1 - {x_B}}} \\times {{1000} \\over {{M_{{w_A}}}}}$$\n\n$$ = 0.52 \\times {{0.1} \\over {0.9}} \\times {{1000} \\over {18}} = 3.2\\,K$$\n\n$${T_b} = T_b^0 + \\Delta {T_b} = 373 + 3.2 = 376.2\\,K$$",
