      "qHtml": "The elevation in boiling point of a solution of 13.44 g of CuCl<sub>2</sub> in 1kg of water using the following information will be (Molecular weight of CuCl<sub>2</sub> = 134.4 and K<sub>b</sub> = 0.52 K molal<sup>-1</sup>)",
