      "q": "The oxidation state of the most electronegative element in the products of the reaction. BaO 2 with dil. H 2 SO 4 are",
      "qHtml": "The oxidation state of the most electronegative element in the products of the reaction. BaO<sub>2</sub> with dil. H<sub>2</sub>SO<sub>4</sub> are",
