      "s": "IIT-JEE 2010 Paper 1 Offline. Correct option: A. According to the Arrhenius equation\n\n$$k = A{e^{ - {E_a}/RT}}$$\n\nwhere, k = rate constant, E a = activation energy and\nT = temperature\n\nFrom the expression, we have that as temperature increases, the rate constant ($$k$$) increases exponentially.",
