      "q": "Consider a reaction aG + bH $$\\to$$ Products. When concentration of both the reactants G and H is doubled, the rate\nincreases by eight times. However, when concentration of G is doubled keeping the concentration of H fixed, the rate is\ndoubled. The overall order of the reaction is",
      "qHtml": "Consider a reaction aG + bH $$\\to$$ Products. When concentration of both the reactants G and H is doubled, the rate\nincreases by eight times. However, when concentration of G is doubled keeping the concentration of H fixed, the rate is\ndoubled. The overall order of the reaction is",
