      "q": "The heating of NH 4 NO 2 at 60–70 °C and NH 4 NO 3 at 200–250 °C is associated with the formation of nitrogen containing compounds X and Y , respectively. X and Y , respectively, are",
      "qHtml": "<p>The heating of NH<sub>4</sub>NO<sub>2</sub> at 60–70 °C and NH<sub>4</sub>NO<sub>3</sub> at 200–250 °C is associated with the formation of nitrogen containing compounds <b>X</b> and <b>Y</b>, respectively. <b>X</b> and <b>Y</b>, respectively, are</p>",
