      "qHtml": "<p>25 mL of household bleach solution was mixed with 30 mL of 0.50 M KI and 10 mL of 4 N acetic acid. In the titration of the liberated iodine, 48 mL of 0.25 N Na<sub>2</sub>S<sub>2</sub>O<sub>3</sub> was used to reach the end point. The molarity of the household bleach solution is</p>",
