      "s": "IIT-JEE 2009 Paper 1 Offline. Correct option: B. The priority order of the substituents on the ring is\n\n$$-$$CN > $$-$$Br > $$-$$OH\n\nCyanide group is given the highest priority.\n\nHence, it is written as suffix benzonitrile and\nother functional groups behave as substituents.\nThe numbering of substituents is done in such\na way that sum of the locants is least.\n\nThe names of substituents are written in\nalphabetical order.\n\n[Diagram: IIT-JEE 2009 Paper 1 Offline Chemistry - Basics of Organic Chemistry Question 13 English Explanation]",
