      "qHtml": "The correct order of acid strength of the following carboxylic acids is\n<br><br><img class=\"quiz-question-image\" src=\"https://imagex.cdn.examgoal.net/1ksrxwle2/f743808e-ad75-484e-b1cf-d3e74e144fb3/a423c1b0-05e1-11ec-aff4-f93815541f69/file-1ksrxwle3.jpeg\" alt=\"JEE Advanced 2019 Paper 1 Offline Chemistry - Aldehydes, Ketones and Carboxylic Acids Question 68 English\" loading=\"lazy\">",
