      "s": "JEE Advanced 2022 Paper 1 Online. Correct option: D. (I) Aniline has $\\mathrm{N}$ atoms hence gives prussian blue colour in Sodium fusion extract test. Aniline also gives white precipitate with Bromine water.\n\n(II) $\\mathbf{O}$-Cresol has phenolic group hence gives violet colour complex with netural $\\mathrm{FeCl}_3$.\n\n(III) Cysteine has 'S' atom, hence gives blood red color when odium S fusion extract of this compound is treated with sodium nitroprusside.\n\n(IV) Caprolactam has $\\mathrm{N}$ atom, hence sodium extract of this compound gives prussian blue color.",
