      "q": "Match the electronic configurations in List-I with appropriate metal complex ions in List-II and choose the correct option.\n\n[Atomic Number: $\\mathrm{Fe}=26, \\mathrm{Mn}=25, \\mathrm{Co}=27$ ]\n\nList - I\nList - II\n\n(P) $t_{2 g}^6 e_g^0$\n(1) $\\left[\\mathrm{Fe}\\left(\\mathrm{H}_2 \\mathrm{O}\\right)_6\\right]^{2+}$\n\n(Q) $t_{2 g}^3 e_g^2$\n(2) $\\left[\\mathrm{Mn}\\left(\\mathrm{H}_2 \\mathrm{O}\\right)_6\\right]^{2+}$\n\n(R) $\\mathrm{e}^2 \\mathrm{t}_2^3$\n(3) $\\left[\\mathrm{Co}\\left(\\mathrm{NH}_3\\right)_6\\right]^{3+}$\n\n(S) $t_{2 g}^4 e_g^2$\n(4) $\\left[\\mathrm{FeCl}_4\\right]^{-}$\n\n(5) $\\left[\\mathrm{CoCl}_4\\right]^{2-}$",
