      "a": 3,
      "s": "JEE Advanced 2017 Paper 2 Offline. Correct option: D. $$\\alpha = {{1 + \\sqrt 5 } \\over 2}$$,\n\n$$\\beta = {{1 - \\sqrt 5 } \\over 2}$$\n\n$${a_4} = {a_3} + {a_2}$$\n\n$$ = 2{a_2} + {a_1}$$\n\n$$ = 3{a_1} + 2{a_0}$$\n\n$$28 = p(3\\alpha + 2) + q(3\\beta + 2)$$\n\n$$28 = (p + q)\\left( {{3 \\over 2} + 2} \\right) + (p - q)\\left( {{{3\\sqrt 5 } \\over 2}} \\right)$$\n\n$$ \\therefore $$ p $$-$$ q = 0\n\nand $$(p + q) \\times {7 \\over 2} = 28$$\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow $$ p + q = 8\n\n$$ \\Rightarrow $$ p = q = 4\n\n$$ \\therefore $$ p + 2q = 12",
