      "qHtml": "Let $${a_1},{a_2},{a_3},.....$$ be in harmonic progression with $${a_1} = 5$$ and $${a_{20}} = 25.$$ The least positive integer $$n$$ for which $${a_n} &lt; 0$$ is",
