      "q": "Let $z$ be a complex number satisfying $|z|^3+2 z^2+4 \\bar{z}-8=0$, where $\\bar{z}$ denotes the complex conjugate of $z$. Let the imaginary part of $z$ be nonzero.\n\nMatch each entry in List-I to the correct entries in List-II .\n\nList - I\nList - II\n\n(P) $|z|^2$ is equal to\n(1) 12\n\n(Q) $|z-\\bar{z}|^2$ is equal to\n(2) 4\n\n(R) $|z|^2+|z+\\bar{z}|^2$ is equal to\n(3) 8\n\n(S) $|z+1|^2$ is equal to\n(4) 10\n\n(5) 7\n\nThe correct option is:",
