      "qHtml": "<p>If $P$ is a point on $C_1$ and $Q$ in another point on $\\mathrm{C}_2$, then $\\frac{\\mathrm{PA}^2+\\mathrm{PB}^2+\\mathrm{PC}^2+\\mathrm{PD}^2}{\\mathrm{QA}^2+\\mathrm{QB}^2+\\mathrm{QC}^2+\\mathrm{QD}^2}$ is equal to :</p>",
