      "q": "Let $\\mathbb{R}$ denote the set of all real numbers. Define the function $f : \\mathbb{R} \\to \\mathbb{R}$ by\n$f(x)=\\left\\{\\begin{array}{cc}2-2 x^2-x^2 \\sin \\frac{1}{x} & \\text { if } x \\neq 0, \\\\ 2 & \\text { if } x=0 .\\end{array}\\right.$\nThen which one of the following statements is TRUE?",
      "qHtml": "<p>Let $\\mathbb{R}$ denote the set of all real numbers. Define the function $f : \\mathbb{R} \\to \\mathbb{R}$ by</p><p>$f(x)=\\left\\{\\begin{array}{cc}2-2 x^2-x^2 \\sin \\frac{1}{x} & \\text { if } x \\neq 0, \\\\ 2 & \\text { if } x=0 .\\end{array}\\right.$</p><p>Then which one of the following statements is TRUE?</p>",
