      "s": "JEE Advanced 2020 Paper 1 Offline. Correct option: D. Given quadratic polynomials, x 2 + 20x $$-$$ 2020 and x 2 $$-$$ 20x + 2020 having a, b distinct real and c, d distinct complex roots respectively.\n\nSo, a + b = $$-$$20, ab = $$-$$2020\n\nand c + d = 20, cd = 2020\n\nNow, ac(a $$-$$c) + ad(a $$-$$ d) + bc(b $$-$$c) + bd(b $$-$$ d)\n\n= a 2 (c + d) $$-$$ a(c 2 + d 2 ) + b 2 (c + d) $$-$$ b(c 2 + d 2 )\n\n= (c + d) (a 2 + b 2 ) $$-$$ (c 2 + d 2 ) (a + b)\n\n= (c + d)[(a + b) 2 $$-$$ 2ab] $$-$$ (a + b)[(c + d) 2 $$-$$ 2cd]\n\n= 20[(20) 2 + 4040] + 20[(20) 2 $$-$$ 4040]\n\n= 2 $$ \\times $$ 20 $$ \\times $$ (20) 2 = 40 $$ \\times $$ 400 = 16000",
