      "s": "IIT-JEE 2007 Paper 1 Offline. Correct option: D. We have,\n\n$${v_r} = {1 \\over 2}(2{r^3} - {r^2} + r)$$\n\n$${v_{r + 1}} = {1 \\over 2}[2{(r + 1)^3} - {(r + 1)^2} + (r + 1)]$$\n\nNow,\n\n$${T_r} = {v_{r + 1}} - {v_r} - 2$$\n\n$$ = [{(r + 1)^3} - {r^3}] - {1 \\over 2}[{(r + 1)^2} - {r^2}] + {1 \\over 2}(1) - 2$$\n\n$$ = 3{r^2} + 2r - 1$$\n\n$$ = (r + 1)(3r - 1)$$\n\nWhich is a composite number",
