      "s": "JEE Advanced 2022 Paper 2 Online. Correct option: C. [Diagram: JEE Advanced 2022 Paper 2 Online Mathematics - Probability Question 20 English Explanation]\n\nA (one of the chosen ball is white)\n\nB (at least one of the chosen ball is green)\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\nP\\left(\\frac{A}{B}\\right) & =\\frac{P(A \\cap B)}{P(B)} \\\\\\\\\n& =\\frac{\\frac{5}{16} \\times \\frac{6}{32}}{\\frac{5}{16} \\times 1+\\frac{8}{16} \\times \\frac{15}{48}+\\frac{3}{16} \\times \\frac{12}{16}} \\\\\\\\\n& =\\frac{15}{156}=\\frac{5}{52}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$",
