      "qHtml": "<p>Let <i>S</i> denote the locus of the point of intersection of the pair of lines</p><p>$4x - 3y = 12\\alpha$,</p><p>$4\\alpha x + 3\\alpha y = 12$,</p><p>where $\\alpha$ varies over the set of non-zero real numbers. Let <i>T</i> be the tangent to <i>S</i> passing through the points $(p, 0)$ and $(0, q)$, $q > 0$, and parallel to the line $4x - \\frac{3}{\\sqrt{2}} y = 0$.</p><p>Then the value of $pq$ is :</p>",
