      "qHtml": "<p>Let $f, g$ and $h$ be real valued functions defined on the interval $[0,1]$ by \n<br><br>$f(x)=e^{x^2}+e^{-x^2}$, \n<br><br>$g(x)=x e^{x^2}+e^{-x^2}$ \n<br><br>and $h(x)=x^2 e^{x^2}+e^{-x^2}$. \n<br><br>If $a, b$ and $c$ denote, respectively, the absolute maximum of $f, g$ and $h$ on $[0,1]$, then :</p>",
