      "s": "IIT-JEE 2006. Correct option: A. $$ \\begin{aligned} \\text { Solution } & =\\left[\\begin{array}{lll} 3 & 2 & 0 \\end{array}\\right] \\cup\\left[\\begin{array}{l} 3 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 0 \\end{array}\\right] \\\\ & =\\left[\\begin{array}{lll} 3 & 2 & 0 \\end{array}\\right]\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc} 1 & 2 & 2 \\\\ -2 & -1 & -1 \\\\ 1 & -4 & -3 \\end{array}\\right]\\left[\\begin{array}{l} 3 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 0 \\end{array}\\right] \\\\ & =\\left[\\begin{array}{lll} -1 & 4 & 4 \\end{array}\\right]\\left[\\begin{array}{l} 3 \\\\ 2 \\\\ 0 \\end{array}\\right]=-3+8=5 \\end{aligned} $$",
