      "q": "Consider the planes $$3x-6y-2z=15$$ and $$2x+y-2z=5.$$\nSTATEMENT-1 : The parametric equations of the line of intersection of the given planes are $$x=3+14t,y=1+2t,z=15t.$$ because\n\nSTATEMENT-2 : The vector $${14\\widehat i + 2\\widehat j + 15\\widehat k}$$ is parallel to the line of intersection of given planes.",
      "qHtml": "Consider the planes $$3x-6y-2z=15$$ and $$2x+y-2z=5.$$ \n<p><b>STATEMENT-1</b>: The parametric equations of the line of intersection of the given planes are $$x=3+14t,y=1+2t,z=15t.$$ <b>because</b></p>\n<p><b>STATEMENT-2</b>: The vector $${14\\widehat i + 2\\widehat j + 15\\widehat k}$$ is parallel to the line of intersection of given planes.</p>",
